      "content": "i know about the lines and the help and whatever, i just don't feel like i need a \"safety\" plan. i just feel like i've done enough. like, i've fought so hard for so long and maybe i've just reached the point where it's okay to just... stop. isn't there such a thing as just being too tired to keep trying?",
